5. **Separate evidence labels.** Use distinct labels for **runtime measurement**, **source derivation**, **seat recommendation**, and **author disposition**. B1�?Ts severity raise is already clearly attributed. B3�?Ts adopted design, D�?Ts causal/routing conclusions, and several historical process claims are not. The opening promise�?"�?oEvery claim �?� MEASURED �?� or �?� MY JUDGMENT�??�?"does not hold for the document as written.
