 128:   The seat's actual qualification was **"not reliably PC or PC+8."** It can hold a previous target or exception vector; the defect is the absence of a reliable current-instruction PC value here. The decoder's source-15 handling and separate `tmp_pc` account check out. [ARM answer:21](/C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/armbfcdecode/codex_decode_20260908.txt:21).
