 203: 
 204: I enumerated the field pairs arithmetically, without executing the shifts. Under the stated 32-bit-`int` interpretation:
 205: 
 206: | Set | Count |
 207: |---|---:|
 208: | All `msb`, `lsb` pairs | **1,024** |
 209: | Negative width | **465** |
 210: | Zero width | **31** |
 211: | Width 31 | **2** |
 212: | Width 32 | **1** |
 213: | Unsafe mask expression | **468** |
 214: | `msb < lsb` | **496** |
 215: | Intersection of the preceding two sets | **465** |
 216: | Union | **499** |
