note "*** FILED AS ONE SITE IN dev_lca.c; CENSUSED THE SAME DAY AND IT IS A CLASS.  Widened low -> med. ***\n\nTHE DERIVERS -- run them, do not trust these numbers, and note they answer DIFFERENT questions:\n\n    # (1) the whole cast population -- mostly HARMLESS and NOT the defect\n    grep -rc '(int)idata\\|(int) idata' src"
note "idata & ~1' is the same shape, milder: it prints 0x0 for a value whose low half is genuinely zero.\n\nSEVERITY REASONING, stated rather than assumed: none of this changes WHETHER the host dies -- the guards are unchanged and the kills are the kills.  It changes only what the log says about WHY, at the one moment the log is al"
