ROW gateworktree SEV med STATE open COMMITS 
TITLE precommit_check.sh validates the WORKING TREE, not the staged content, so it cannot see a staging omission
state_note " clone at that SHA reds with `UNCLASSIFIED'.  **precommit_check.sh reported PRECOMMIT_PASS 0 hard immediately before that commit**, because the working tree already carried the manifest edit -- it was simply never staged.\n\n    git show HEAD:tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py | grep -c sgi_mte_fill_probe.py  -> 0\n    gre"
state_note "s one step to the left of the thing it guards.\n\n*** IT INTERACTS WITH A POLICY THIS PROJECT ALREADY HOLDS, which is why it is a row and not a note. ***  The carrier forbids `git add -A' and directory adds, so every commit here stages by EXPLICIT PATH.  That is strictly safer against INCLUDING the wrong file -- the failure "
state_note 'ontrols -- red on a probe staged without its manifest entry, green when both are staged.\n\n*** CONFIRMED BY codex AND WIDER THAN I FILED IT.  THE GATE SELECTS FILES FROM THE INDEX AND\nTHEN READS THEIR CONTENTS FROM THE WORKING TREE. ***\n\n    CHANGED=$(git diff --cached --name-only)      <- NAMES, from the index\n    cmp -s '
state_note 'a bare `-f`.**  It does not verify index membership at all.\n\n*** THE FIX IS NOT A FLAG, AND codex NAMED THE TRAP IN THE OBVIOUS ONE. ***  Blindly replacing\nreads with `git show ":$path"` would inspect the WRONG version during the common before-staging\nrun, because *"nothing staged" normally means the index equals HEAD, no'
state_note 'lters and newline conversion (locally\n  the carrier copies are LF and `core.autocrlf` is false).\n\n**SEVERITY: this does not change what any product code does.  What it changes is what a GREEN GATE\nMEANS**, on every round this project has recorded -- which is why it is filed high among harness\nitems rather than as a tidy-up.'
state_note ' is what a GREEN GATE\nMEANS**, on every round this project has recorded -- which is why it is filed high among harness\nitems rather than as a tidy-up.  It is a tooling change owing negative controls in both directions\n(prove a staged-only defect REDS in index mode; prove a working-tree-only defect does NOT), so it\nships as'
