90: ## Q5. DECLINE is right; the warrant\u2019s \u201cbreaking oracle / round left free\u201d half is overstated
91: 
92: **Against, as asked.**
93: 
94: Member 4 of the option set does apply: the write arm already stores a value. Calling the read \u201cunimplemented\u201d is a stretch \u2014 the register is modelled; the **index** is untrusted. A mirrored ACCEPT (`>> 3` on both sides) round-trips a single `sd`/`ld` at one address, which is what a save/restore of that register would do. Overlap corruption is `sgitexindex`\u2019s defect, already filed.
95: 
96: The \u201cfuture `sgitexindex` becomes a breaking oracle change\u201d argument is **already true of a row this detector shipped before this round.** `SITES` for TEX is:
